representation: supported. Targets: B-CONDITIONAL-ROW-0019.

Retain the historical reconciliation and exclusion. The current owner distinguishes seven-molybdenum heptamolybdate tetrahydrate from one-molybdenum diammonium orthomolybdate; the latter is not its anhydrous parent. The annotation explains why that former name is absent. It does not describe all later CH-05 decisions and must not license every malformed molybdate occurrence.

