## Limits And Additional Notes

- Scientific attribution is to the genuine frozen peer report and preserved original primary authors. This technical assembler is an original primary author for 0265/0292 and makes no second independent scientific judgment.
- scientific_review:true describes only the bounded comment-semantic review. needs_curation, all forty inherited unresolved obligations, source/quantity/product/form/ownership/role/export limits and the five separate original dispositions remain.
- findings:[] means no new source/scientific findings in this thirteen-comment scope. The actual report-only exclusion observation W01-RETENTION-REPORT-EXCLUSION-PRECISION-001 and its append-only clarification are separately preserved and bound; no native finding history or issue closure is fabricated.
- The EDTA count/role wording and BSA seven prior memberships are historical annotations, not new current recounts or whole-owner approvals. Current equality is established separately from old pending-B wording and does not create admission.
- The unchanged native helper is inspected at real W da45. B2 current owners/candidate/canonical inputs are separately verified physical artifacts in BOUND-INPUTS; W source is not falsely repinned to B2. Native working-tree source provenance is an attestation, not proof that private input bytes are committed.
- The predecessor was privately persisted and did not invoke canonical save_review. The user now explicitly authorizes and requires the unchanged native saver at the real W01 root; the separate persistence addendum records its actual command and result. No fixture root, output-path override, Git-visibility relaxation or source-base revision is permitted.
- The three peer pre-output constructor failures remain preserved and disclosed in the actual peer REVIEW. The technical exploratory hold list/dict interpretation noted in WORKFLOW was corrected before persistence; forty is verified from the exact global ledger.
- Original nested source-decision selectors copied inside historical holds retain their declared normalized-list conventions; this assembly does not relabel those as file-root JSON pointers. Direct peer evidence selectors in BOUND-INPUTS were actually resolved.
- Historical predecessor scope: No new research, provider calls, source edits, native prepare/apply/generation, canonical save, Git mutation, GitHub action or comment application occurred. Read-only Git HEAD and provenance queries were executed. This successor performs only the newly authorized canonical native review save; no source/canonical mapping or publication approval follows.
- Persistence preparation/operator: Codex W01 /root. Original scientific reviewer /root/skeptical_review and original primary authors remain unchanged; metadata/source reinspection is not a new independent scientific vote. Original assessment interval: 2026-11-10T01:56:24.807648Z through 2026-11-10T01:56:26.705053Z.
- Technical assembler: Codex /root/issue_context (worker01), technical assembler only. Root scope explanations and DECISION-MATRIX are assembly context, not independent votes.
- No literal historical source/provider/retrieval timestamp was changed. Native evidence accessed_at records this assembly access to preserved artifacts.

