- assessment_id: COMMENT-0019
  area: representation
  topic: Retain the bounded historical or predicate explanation as an unselected recommendation
  outcome: supported
  target_ids:
  - B-CONDITIONAL-ROW-0019
  evidence_ids:
  - PRIMARY-0019
  - SKEPTICAL-0019
  - JUDGMENT-0019
  - ACTUAL-0019
  - SOURCE-0019-0
  - SOURCE-0019-1
  - SOURCE-0019-2
  - SOURCE-0019-3
  summary: Retain the historical reconciliation and exclusion. The current owner distinguishes
    seven-molybdenum heptamolybdate tetrahydrate from one-molybdenum diammonium orthomolybdate;
    the latter is not its anhydrous parent. The annotation explains why that former
    name is absent. It does not describe all later CH-05 decisions and must not license
